# samples/ holds small, public, freely redistributable DFIR test fixtures.
# It is NOT for case evidence. Real evidence belongs in data_store/, which is
# deny-by-default and must stay that way — see data_store/.gitignore.
#
# One specific exclusion, and the reason for it:
#
#   12-carve-ext2.dd is 124 MB. GitHub rejects any file over 100 MB outright,
#   so a push carrying it fails rather than warns. The image is not lost —
#   archives/12-carve-ext2.zip holds the same data at 1.1 MB compressed.
#   Extract it locally when you need it; the extraction stays out of git.
12-carve-ext2.dd

# Extraction directories for the archives in archives/.
12-carve-ext2/
sleuthkit_test_data/

# Large samples, fetched on demand by dev-scripts/fetch-samples.sh. They are
# 112 MB to 2 GB each, so they cannot go in git: GitHub's 100 MB per-file block
# applies on every plan, and LFS uploads to lfs.github.com, which some networks
# do not permit. Fetch them; never commit them.
large/

# The root .gitignore drops **.zip as junk. These two are not junk — they are
# sample data, and 12-carve-ext2.zip is the only committed copy of the image
# excluded above. Re-include exactly these two, nothing else.
!archives/12-carve-ext2.zip
!archives/sleuthkit_test_data.zip
